WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
That's fine. I'll live here with you. Cheers.

2
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,470
It's too small. Sorry.

3
00:00:07,790 --> 00:00:09,590
Brother, please sleep on the bed tonight

4
00:00:09,590 --> 00:00:13,350
I'll just break it on the ground. That's not good. It's okay.

5
00:00:13,350 --> 00:00:15,150
When my wife took the kids here to play before,

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,830
I can do that too, right?

7
00:00:18,580 --> 00:00:20,660
Brother, why don’t you sleep a little longer?

8
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,420
The advantage of us doing part-time jobs is that

9
00:00:22,420 --> 00:00:24,020
No need to do it like they do in offices

10
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,900
You have to clock in and go to work on time every day

11
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:28,100
So I can relax a little bit every day

12
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:31,060
You said you wanted to take me to buy a motorcycle, so I couldn’t sleep. Get up quickly.

13
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:32,780
Let's go buy a motorcycle together

14
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,160
I'll treat you to breakfast, okay, okay

15
00:00:36,320 --> 00:00:37,440
The noodle soup there is good

16
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:40,040
It's quite delicious for ten yuan a portion. Let's go over and try it.

17
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,380
Brother, this can be dipped in satay sauce

18
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:46,660
It depends on how you taste it

19
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:48,700
It might taste delicious if you dip it. Try it.

20
00:00:49,390 --> 00:00:51,150
People who are immortals know how to eat

21
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:53,390
After eating it like this, I found that the taste is really different.

22
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:56,380
You said these are beef balls, they are beef balls

23
00:00:56,540 --> 00:00:57,700
How do you make these beef balls?

24
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:58,900
Do you think it tastes delicious?

25
00:00:59,020 --> 00:00:59,980
It's a specialty

26
00:01:00,180 --> 00:01:01,340
Hard to find in general places

27
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:04,020
Such delicious beef balls are really good
